UIDropdown:bTabCommitsHighlightedRow {
    at    Source/DreamGUIControls/Public/Interaction/UIDropdown.h#UIDropdown:bTabCommitsHighlightedRow
    src   "What Tab and Shift+Tab do in the open list besides closing it: on, the row the player is on is chosen first, as an\nHTML select does, and the Tab then moves on past the dropdown; off, the list only closes. Tab never stays in an open\nlist (it is pushed with EDreamPopupTabBehavior::CloseAndContinue)."
    text  "在打开的列表中，Tab和Shift+Tab除了关闭列表之外还做什么：开启时，先选中玩家当前所在的行，与\nHTML select一样，随后Tab继续移过下拉框；关闭时，列表仅关闭。Tab从不停留在打开的\n列表中（它是以EDreamPopupTabBehavior::CloseAndContinue方式压入的）。"
    state machine
}

UIDropdown:bUseInteractionBlock {
    at    Source/DreamGUIControls/Public/Interaction/UIDropdown.h#UIDropdown:bUseInteractionBlock
    src   "Keep the press outside the open list from what is under it, for this dropdown whatever the project says.\n\nA press outside the open list closes it. Off, the default, what it does next is the project's choice for all its\nmenus (UDreamGUISettings::bMenusConsumeOutsideClick): by default it then reaches whatever is under the pointer, as\nSComboBox's list -- a menu on the Slate menu stack -- lets it. On, it goes no further for this dropdown, as a click\non the full-screen blocker this used to build went nowhere else (EDreamPopupOutsideClick Consume / PassThrough). A\npress on the dropdown's own face closes the list either way and never opens it again."
    text  "使打开的列表之外的按压不会到达其下方的内容，对此下拉框而言，无论项目如何设置。\n\n在打开的列表之外按压会关闭它。关闭时（默认），接下来做什么由项目为其所有\n菜单统一决定（UDreamGUISettings::bMenusConsumeOutsideClick）：默认情况下按压会到达指针下方的内容，正如\nSComboBox的列表——Slate菜单栈上的菜单——所允许的那样。开启时，对此下拉框而言按压不再继续传递，就像点击\n过去构建的全屏阻挡器不会去到别处一样（EDreamPopupOutsideClick Consume / PassThrough）。无论哪种情况，\n在下拉框自身表面上的按压都会关闭列表，并且不会再打开它。"
    state machine
}

