UIDropdown:SetListRoot {
    at    Source/DreamGUIControls/Public/Interaction/UIDropdown.h#UIDropdown:SetListRoot
    src   "The parts, settable from code. All four are EditAnywhere weak references the designer and .dui\nalways reached by reflection while no caller could -- the UUIToggle transition-target hole.\nA part swap invalidates the built list; the caption re-applies at once."
    text  "各部件，可从代码设置。四个都是EditAnywhere弱引用，设计器和.dui\n一直通过反射访问它们，而没有任何调用方能够做到——即UUIToggle过渡目标的漏洞。\n替换部件会使已构建的列表失效；标题会立即重新应用。"
    state machine
}

UIDropdown:SetOptions {
    at    Source/DreamGUIControls/Public/Interaction/UIDropdown.h#UIDropdown:SetOptions
    src   "Replace the options. An open list is rebuilt at once, so none of its rows stands for an option\nthat is gone; a closed one builds its rows the next time it opens."
